        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "The 2 dashboards are available at these links:\n<https://datastudio.example/u/3/reporting/8a47c1e5-92bd-4f60-b318-7e25d93a640c/page/Rm42Q/edit>\n<https://datastudio.example/u/3/reporting/31fe8a72-c649-487d-905b-a4267d1ce850/page/p_v8k2rmtqzx/edit>",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 2,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Although there are two milestones, I was hoping we could use one fixed-price project with a single milestone 😅",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 3,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Oh sorry!",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 4,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "If your data has already been migrated, I’m going to handle both dashboards together.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 5,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Is that relevant?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 6,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "In that case, once both are finished together, I’ll approve them together :)",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 7,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Once I’ve brought all the data together in BigQuery, I’ll let you know; I still need to finish that.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 8,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Since the funds take time to clear, setting it up as one milestone would let me use the amount for myself in one go.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 9,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Is one client’s bigquery ready, and if so, which one?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 10,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Right now, neither is ready; I’ll need a few days.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 11,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Once you have it done, let me know; I’ll then handle them together for you in one go.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 12,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Could you extend the due date in the meantime? If possible, also make the first milestone fund the complete project at 1200$.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 13,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "thank you",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 14,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Thanks, and you're welcome. Could you please approve my request above? I would appreciate it.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 15,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Can you update the funds to 1200$? They are still showing 600.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 16,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Can you check the Juniper Tide | Analytics &amp; Growth Console? I added a new data source called 'JuniperTide_DataStudio_metrics'; it should have everything connected.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 17,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "I'll check it now.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 18,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "As for the funding, I think we're good now ^",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 19,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "For the second data source, though, a few more days might be needed!",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 20,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "I can see 9 more data sources on the dashboard, so is this really the only one I have to use?",
